{"data":{"body":"[P2] Reject unknown or misplaced selector fields during prevalidation. The catch-all only validates matcher values, so an inactive occurrence branch containing a typo such as `parnet` or a top-level `$linked` produces no schema error; a one-span trace can therefore pass even though the two-span branch is invalid. Whitelist canonical span properties plus the supported controls in expectation, parent, relation, link, and `$not` selectors, and add an inactive-branch regression using an unknown field.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx8745QzA","finding_digest":"b0f8751f6c18b7dd03dcca04e2819afc1540d2f304694f4c35e84212fcc198ed","finding_id":"arf_v1_wd4hkh3mdc352a64zicofam27q","finding_key":"validators.py::_span_assertion_errors::inactive-count-occurrence-schema","identity_key":"validators.py::_span_assertion_errors::inactive-count-occurrence-schema","line":407,"observation_digest":"a1c9b76602caa13ffc6dd7ddf1e036b23e68bac9fff1e0e173500731831d9ead","observation_id":"aro_v1_uhe3ozqczkqt77dn27o7dybwwi","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_otel/validators.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_wd4hkh3mdc352a64zicofam27q","published_at":"2026-10-04T01:58:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hd77eutnllapbkuwr5vuwgp7iu","reviewed_base_sha":"43872f8d5dd917fe3ee6d01a6c953c1ff67c5fe4","reviewed_head_sha":"139d0caa21a65bb27169ae2b7cc89f9d9b1eecab","reviewer":"codex","start_line":404,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_sebky2env4tgjh2owvs6va7nl5","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-04T01:58:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
